Notes.

* Command 1 recompiled the whole dependency chain (28 jobs) after the oleans were
  removed; `Metronome.Bridge.Host` and `Metronome.Bridge.CfgWrite` build without
  warnings under `-DwarningAsError=true`.
* `axioms.txt` shows only `propext`, `Classical.choice` and `Quot.sound`, or no
  axioms (e.g. `blockOk_all`, `ack_bridge`, `drain_bridge`, `rackv_witness`).
  Theorems that go through the cut specs' `bv_decide` certificates carry those
  certificate axioms as well (`linkRelR_step`: `HostCmd.ah_completion`,
  `al_completion`, `data_completion`, `ign_holds`, `Bridge.Host.bv2_cases`;
  `queue_fields_arb`/`cfg_compose_bridge`: `CoreQueue.pack_take` and this file's
  existing `pack_eq_append`/`wl_wd`/`wh_wd`/`wl_wh`).  These are inherited from
  the pre-existing cut proofs; the new proofs introduce no `bv_decide` and no
  `native_decide`.  The one kernel computation in the additions is
  `blockOk_all := by decide` (a finite check of the block table).
* Scratch files (probes, generated axioms file, per-run logs) are in
  `data/raw/lean_bridge_v4_20261121c/scratch/`.
